Description: 

This CTF module consists of 18 CTFs which takes us through a lost book of perceptrons. 
The year is 2030 and everyone uses AI and almost no one knows how to brainstrom or build 
stuff on their own. This module taught us about the early pages of AI knowledge how neurons 
work and how perceptrons are expressed and trained, and why responsible use matters.

